<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Sun Alliance to axe 16 pct of staff - union.</title>
<headline>Belgian Sun Alliance to axe 16 pct of staff - union.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Alliance NV/SA, the Belgian unit of UK insurer Royal &amp; Sun Alliance, plans to dismiss 16 percent of its staff, or 25 employees, in Belgium as part of the group's global staff reduction drive, Belgian union SETCa said.</p>
<p>The union said in a statement on Wednesday it opposed the plan since profitability at the company exceeded that of its competitors. The plan was part of global staff cuts involving 4,000 job losses in the UK and 1,000 in the rest of the world.</p>
<p>SETCa said the issue should be resolved by cuts in working hours and redistribution of labour.</p>
